{
    "title": "EliteSingles: Serious Dating",
    "description": "<h2><b> Are you looking for someone with the same values? Something serious? Love? Look no further, you\u2019re in the right place. </b></h2>\r\n\r\nWith a matching algorithm almost as sophisticated as our users (over 85% of our members have a high level of education), we at EliteSingles have helped numerous singles, just like you, find love through our unique approach to match making. \r\n\r\nNow it\u2019s your turn. All you need to do is create your dating profile today, and we\u2019ll take care of the rest!\r\n\r\nFinding love needn\u2019t be complicated. The first step on this exciting journey is completing our unique personality test, which we developed hand in hand with professional psychologists, and refined over the years. \r\n\r\nThroughout this introspective test, we\u2019ll get to know you better, are you introverted? Extroverted? What exactly are you looking for in a partner? We\u2019ll compile all this information about you, and your preferences to present you with a daily list of highly curated individuals we are sure you would match with.\r\n\r\nProviding a safe and secure platform for you to connect with others, is just as paramount as finding those others for you! Through a mixture of rigorous manual assessments, and automated testing, we review all new users on our platform, to ensure we\u2019ll only match you with others looking for love. \r\n\r\nEliteSingles will help you discover your perfect match and find that long lasting chemistry that you\u2019ve been longing for. Download EliteSingles today and give love a chance.\r\n\r\nEliteSingles Free Dating App Features:\r\n\u25b8 Take our bespoke personality test developed by professional psychologists\r\n\u25b8 Create your dating profile\r\n\u25b8 Receive a curated list of matches every day\r\n\u25b8 Interact with others using smiles, and likes\r\n \r\nUpgrade to the Premium EliteSingles Dating App and enjoy:\r\n\u25b8Unlimited access to view your matches\u2019 photos\r\n\u25b8Send and receive unlimited messages\r\n\u25b8See who liked you\r\n\u25b8See who visited your profile\r\n \r\n<b>Privacy Policy Information</b>\r\nYour safety and privacy are important to us. Our Profile Verification, SSL Encryption, and Fraud Detection Systems all provide you with a dating app where you can feel comfortable sharing what you want, with whoever you want, when you want.\r\n\r\n \u25b8Any questions or suggestions for improvement? Get in touch with us at info@elitesingles.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h2><b> Are you looking for someone with the same values? Something serious? Love? Look no further, you\u2019re in the right place. </b></h2><br><br>With a matching algorithm almost as sophisticated as our users (over 85% of our members have a high level of education), we at EliteSingles have helped numerous singles, just like you, find love through our unique approach to match making. <br><br>Now it\u2019s your turn. All you need to do is create your dating profile today, and we\u2019ll take care of the rest!<br><br>Finding love needn\u2019t be complicated. The first step on this exciting journey is completing our unique personality test, which we developed hand in hand with professional psychologists, and refined over the years. <br><br>Throughout this introspective test, we\u2019ll get to know you better, are you introverted? Extroverted? What exactly are you looking for in a partner? We\u2019ll compile all this information about you, and your preferences to present you with a daily list of highly curated individuals we are sure you would match with.<br><br>Providing a safe and secure platform for you to connect with others, is just as paramount as finding those others for you! Through a mixture of rigorous manual assessments, and automated testing, we review all new users on our platform, to ensure we\u2019ll only match you with others looking for love. <br><br>EliteSingles will help you discover your perfect match and find that long lasting chemistry that you\u2019ve been longing for. Download EliteSingles today and give love a chance.<br><br>EliteSingles Free Dating App Features:<br>\u25b8 Take our bespoke personality test developed by professional psychologists<br>\u25b8 Create your dating profile<br>\u25b8 Receive a curated list of matches every day<br>\u25b8 Interact with others using smiles, and likes<br> <br>Upgrade to the Premium EliteSingles Dating App and enjoy:<br>\u25b8Unlimited access to view your matches\u2019 photos<br>\u25b8Send and receive unlimited messages<br>\u25b8See who liked you<br>\u25b8See who visited your profile<br> <br><b>Privacy Policy Information</b><br>Your safety and privacy are important to us. Our Profile Verification, SSL Encryption, and Fraud Detection Systems all provide you with a dating app where you can feel comfortable sharing what you want, with whoever you want, when you want.<br><br> \u25b8Any questions or suggestions for improvement? Get in touch with us at info@elitesingles.com",
